  "summary": "Aspect A (knowledge): xa02's case-specific card retrieval plus a static Reference knowledge of card-cited for/against facts (heart-rate timing K01-K04/K08/K10/K29, depth K24-K26/K17, position versus ischemic QRS change K12/K14/K16/K18/K19/K28, recurrence and baseline K42/K43/K22/K23/K36) extended with K15 (positional QRS and ST changes are not proportional, so a QRS change below the flag thresholds does not exclude a step-like positional shift) and the matching How-to-use lines.",
